Licensing overview
==================

This repository contains two different kinds of material, licensed differently.

1. The engine, reader and tooling: MIT License (below)
------------------------------------------------------
The MIT License applies to the source code and configuration in this
repository except the excluded material listed in section 2. This includes:

  - src/                 story engine, checker and web reader
  - scripts/             build, checking and image tooling
  - stories/index.ts     story registry
  - .claude/             agent and hook configuration
  - index.html, package.json, tsconfig.json and similar project files

You may use this code, including to build your own games with your own stories.

2. Back to the Future content: NOT licensed
-------------------------------------------
The following are excluded from the MIT License. No licence of any kind is
granted for them:

  - stories/stopped-clocks/  (story text, characters, dialogue, image prompts,
                              illustrations, theme and all other files in it)
  - docs/stopped-clocks/     (story bible and outline)
  - reference/               (art reference images)

"Back to the Future", its characters (including Doc Brown, Marty McFly and the
Tannen family), names, places, vehicles and related marks are the property of
their respective owners, including Universal City Studios and Amblin
Entertainment. This is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by those owners. The excluded
material is included only so that the project can be run for personal,
non-commercial use. It may not be redistributed or used commercially. The
illustrations were generated with third-party AI image tools and are provided
without any rights or warranties.

To build something of your own, replace everything in stories/stopped-clocks/
with your own original story pack.

3. Third-party components
-------------------------
  - DSEG fonts (npm package "dseg", bundled at build time): SIL Open Font
    License 1.1.
  - Literata and Big Shoulders Display (loaded from Google Fonts at runtime):
    SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  - Other npm dependencies are covered by their own licences.


